   "InfoDisplay_109000002_Title": "Divinity of Septimont",
   "InfoDisplay_109000003_Text": "\"Even in the end… I never found the so-called power of the dragon.\nAs the knight who served the 17th head of the family, I failed to protect the one I swore to. I failed to fulfill her wish, to redeem her family's name.\nI achieved nothing. Died in a foreign land... Ha, what a pitiful, wasted life.\"",
   "InfoDisplay_109000003_Title": "Fisalia Knight's Letter",
-  "InfoDisplay_10900002_Text": "I. Objectives\n\n1. Assess the feasibility of spore essence extraction.\n\n2. Investigate the diverse effects of spores at different concentrations.\n\nII. Materials\n\nHoochiefs, with one uncontaminated and one contaminated specimen per group; 1ml syringe, saline solution.\n\nIII. Procedure\n\n1. Group two Hoochiefs with similar body weights, weigh them, and assign unique identifiers.\n\n2. Extract spore essence from contaminated individuals, blend it with saline solution, and establish concentrations of 0.2%, 0.4%, and 0.8%, categorized by groups.\n\n3. Administer various concentrations of the spore extracts to uncontaminated individuals, observe their activity, and record findings.\n\n4. After completing the experiment, conduct statistical analysis on the results and formulate conclusions.\n\nIV. Conclusions\n\n1. The spore essence extraction process results in approximately 58% loss, but extraction remains viable.\n\n2. The 0.4% concentration of the extract exhibits the optimal effect, although outcomes may differ based on subjects and necessitate further validation.\n\n\n\nNote: Achieved interim success. Transitioning the experimental subjects to humans is authorized.",
+  "InfoDisplay_10900002_Text": "I. Objectives\n1. Assess the feasibility of spore essence extraction.\n2. Investigate the diverse effects of spores at different concentrations.\nII. Materials\nHoochiefs, with one uncontaminated and one contaminated specimen per group; 1ml syringe, saline solution.\nIII. Procedure\n1. Group two Hoochiefs with similar body weights, weigh them, and assign unique identifiers.\n2. Extract spore essence from contaminated individuals, blend it with saline solution, and establish concentrations of 0.2%, 0.4%, and 0.8%, categorized by groups.\n3. Administer various concentrations of the spore extracts to uncontaminated individuals, observe their activity, and record findings.\n4. After completing the experiment, conduct statistical analysis on the results and formulate conclusions.\nIV. Conclusions\n1. The spore essence extraction process results in approximately 58% loss, but extraction remains viable.\n2. The 0.4% concentration of the extract exhibits the optimal effect, although outcomes may differ based on subjects and necessitate further validation.\n\nNote: Achieved interim success. Transitioning the experimental subjects to humans is authorized.",
   "InfoDisplay_10900002_Title": "Experiment Report",
   "InfoDisplay_10900003_Text": "Finally got out of that old cave, but we're moving to a new cave now! This time, it's not just any old cave—it's a nice one, a cozy home cave! From now on, this cave is our home!",
   "InfoDisplay_10900003_Title": "Maosan's Diary",
@@ -96692,13 +96692,13 @@
   "InfoDisplay_10900005_Title": "Note of Long'er",
   "InfoDisplay_10900006_Text": "As I grow old and reflect on my life, I am haunted by the regret of not fulfilling a legend someone once told me. They said that if the most important person in your life is willing to fulfill this legend, your relationship will be blessed by the heavens until death do you part. I missed my chance and have always felt like we were just passing through each other's lives.\nBut now, as I face my impending death with only regrets, I feel compelled to find the place where we promised to meet and fulfill the legend. Even though it may be too late for me, I hope this notice can reach young people who still have a chance to hold onto their loved ones. So please, kind lady at the Pioneer Association, share this unknown legend and perhaps someone can finally solve its mystery.\n<b>Under the crescent moon, we roam\nOn a screen court, stars dance and moan\nTimeless, by this heart-shaped lake\nTogether, hand in hand we take\nStarry-eyed, our love shall never break.</b>",
   "InfoDisplay_10900006_Title": "Last Wish",
-  "InfoDisplay_10900007_Text": "I recently received an invitation from the Pioneer Association to explore the culinary delights of Jinzhou. Eager to embark on this food journey, I wandered through the city's streets, savoring every dish the city has to offer. My journey led me to uncover delightful surprises that have now come together to form this unique booklet—a comprehensive food map of Jinzhou. I hope that as you read these pages, you will feel inspired to embark on your own food exploration—then my hard work is worth it. For it is in the moment when flavors dance upon your taste buds, igniting a symphony of sensations that resonate deep within, that the true essence of these delicacies lies.\n\n<color=Highlight>Panhua's Restaurant</color>, rating: ☆☆☆☆☆\n\nWhile writing this booklet, I found myself seated at a small table at Panhua's Restaurant, enveloped by the vibrant buzz of lively conversations. It was here that I witnessed a heartwarming gathering involving a Patroller who had just completed her duty, her friend wearing a blue beret, and another friend in an icy demeanor. Before the Patroller could sit down, she swiftly placed an order for Poached Chicken, Perilla Salad, and Maocai before being joined by her friends. They shared anecdotes with each other, and the vivid expressions and gestures of that Patroller made the atmosphere even more lively. This experience makes me confident that Panhua's Restaurant has the ability to provide a relaxing and spirited dining environment, making it a standout choice for any culinary enthusiast.\n\n\n\nAs I penned these words, the Poached Chicken arrived at my table. While the chicken itself appeared flat, when immersed in the restaurant's specially crafted sauce, it provides an unforgettable flavor. As I savored each bite, the meat juices burst forth, accompanied by a fresh aroma that lingered in the mouth. The accompanying vegetables, stir-fried to perfection, boasted a vibrant green, complemented by sizzling oil droplets. Paired with tender and fluffy rice, the dish left me with only one word in my mind—\"delicious\". \n\n\n\nSo I couldn't resist having another serving:)\n\n<color=Highlight>Jewel Boba</color>, rating: ☆☆☆☆\n\nI found myself longing for more as I savored the delightful Jewel Boba, each sip leaving me yearning for another taste. If I had a second stomach dedicated solely to desserts, there's no doubt it would be reserved for the delicious dessert soup offered here in Jinzhou.. And if I were to recommend just one, Jewel Boba would undoubtedly be my top choice. Boasting over thirty years of renowned excellence, this sweet treat remains as delicious and affordable as ever.\n\nDuring my visit, I ordered the new buy-one-get-one-free dessert soup. The owner told me that its launch was inspired by a happy couple celebrating their anniversary at the shop—the owner, pleased with their happiness, presented them with a specially made drink. As the couple highly praised its taste, the owner decided to share its taste to more customers. After listening to this warm story, I, who was holding two cups alone, couldn't shake the bitterness of coming here alone. Luckily, the sweetness of the Jewel Boba somewhat lifted my spirits.\n\n<color=Highlight>Liuxian Teahouse</color>, rating: ☆☆☆☆\n\nLiuxian Teahouse boasts its Bittberry Tea with distinctive bitterness, which forces you to question everything with a single sip. However, beneath the initial shock, a subtle sweetness emerges, with great persistence in the mouth. \n\nUnlike the bustling Panhua's Restaurant, Liuxian Teahouse provides a tranquil atmosphere where one can recline in a chair, fan in hand, and while away the hours immersed in the peaceful embrace of life unfolding around them.\n\n<color=Highlight>Borderland Cuisine</color>, rating: ☆☆☆☆☆\n\n...",
