   "InfoDisplay_10900008_Title": "Mochelin Dining Guide: Tasty Jinzhou - Food Exploration",
-  "InfoDisplay_10900009_Text": "We Promise, We Deliver—Lollo Logistics\n\n\n\nAway from Jinzhou and yearning for its specialties? Look no further–Lollo Logistics has got you covered!\n\nStaying in Jinzhou and craving specialties from the Six Countries? No problem–Lollo Logistics is here to help again!\n\nPicture this: when you open those take-out boxes, hot steam rises, carrying the aroma that wafts into your nostrils, igniting your appetite for these delights.\n\nFor unrivaled quality and swift delivery, make the smart choice–choose Lollo Logistics!\n\n\n\nBodyBuilder: Totally! Wasn't in Jinzhou before, but I was craving Panhua's Restaurant's Pulled Chicken so bad. Every sec, min, hour, couldn't stop thinking about it, lost sleep over it. Finally gave in, called Lollo Logistics, and ordered takeout. However, the delivery guy forgot pickup, but drove me to Jinzhou for that Pulled Chicken!\n\nAM JUST A BRUSH: Hahaha! Bad News: Forgot to pick up the takeout; Good News: Ended up bringing the customer to the restaurant.\n\nAAA Fresh Ingredients Wholesaler: Definitely fresh. Trustworthy!\n\nGreen Light Forever: Thanks, mate! You can count on us. We always keep our promises!",
