   "InfoDisplay_11050102_Title": "Report on Exploration Work",
   "InfoDisplay_11050103_Text": "<b>[Latest Announcement]</b>\nDate: AL157\nContents: Due to the recent frequent occurrence of TD Outbreak, abnormal sub concentration in Wuthering Waves and other special circumstances, the Sentinel Sculpture and Canal Excavation Project will be halted with immediate effect, and all Ministry of Development and Midnight Rangers staff will be withdrawn immediately, with the restarting time of the project to be determined.\n\n<b>[ Expired Announcement]</b>\nDate: AL154\nContents: The road into the Gorges of Spirits was officially opened today, and Midnight Rangers special teams encountered a large accumulation of TDTD Outbreaks in the valley. The TD Outbreak was extremely dangerous, and the number of deaths, serious injuries, and missing persons is too high to be fully accounted for yet. The commander-in-chief died heroically in combat, and Jiyan has been temporarily appointed as the interim commander-in-chief.\n\n<b>[ Expired Announcement]</b>\nDate: AL140\nContents: Commissioned by Ministry of Development, the Midnight Rangers special squad will be in charge of the survey and cleanup of the Gorges of Spirits plot from today, so that Ministry of Development can enter the valley to carry out surveys at a later stage. It is initially expected that access to Gorges of Spirits will be opened by 150.",
   "InfoDisplay_11050103_Title": "Camp Notice",
-  "InfoDisplay_11050104_Text": "Hardness: 6\n\nDensity: 3.0-3.5 g/cm³\n\nCompressive Strength: 3000-5000 kg/cm³\n\n\n\nThe specimen is named Moire Stone, characterized by its fine structure, high hardness, and strong compressive strength. It exhibits excellent chemical stability and can withstand extreme temperature variations.\n\nMoire Stones are widely distributed in the Gorges of Spirits, forming large-scale deposits that faciliate easy mining. Sizable blocks can be easily mined. All these factors make Moire Stones excellent construction materials suitable for large-scale sculptures, exterior walls of buildings, and hard paving.\n\n\n\n<i>Note: It is used in the construction of Jinzhou and the creation of the Sentinel sculpture.</i>",
+  "InfoDisplay_11050104_Text": "Hardness: 6\nDensity: 3.0-3.5 g/cm³\nCompressive Strength: 3000-5000 kg/cm³\n\nThe specimen is named Moire Stone, characterized by its fine structure, high hardness, and strong compressive strength. It exhibits excellent chemical stability and can withstand extreme temperature variations.\nMoire Stones are widely distributed in the Gorges of Spirits, forming large-scale deposits that faciliate easy mining. Sizable blocks can be easily mined. All these factors make Moire Stones excellent construction materials suitable for large-scale sculptures, exterior walls of buildings, and hard paving.\n\n<i>Note: It is used in the construction of Jinzhou and the creation of the Sentinel sculpture.</i>",
   "InfoDisplay_11050104_Title": "Experiment Report on Moire Stone",
   "InfoDisplay_11050105_Text": "Date: AL154\nContents: In the operation to recover the Gorges of Spirits, Midnight Rangers encountered extremely unfavorable circumstances such as the death of the commander-in-chief and the disparity between the enemy and us. However, our warrior Jiyan was outstanding in battle, and fought against the large-scale TDTD Outbreak for three days with only a single special team left, and stood firm until the arrival of support from large troops, and then merged the military forces and successfully defeated most of the exploration results. The TDTD Outbreak was defeated in one fell swoop, and most of the exploration results were successfully preserved.",
   "InfoDisplay_11050105_Title": "Gorges of Spirits Tacet Discord Battle Report",
